  clientName: Mills
  jobDescription: Build a direct crossing across the 90-meter excavation between
    Ironhaven's equipment storage area and active work site. Carry the mobile crane
    safely to the opposite side. During testing, examine overloaded or broken members
    and identify where a problem begins before revising the design.
